# CR 616.1. Two replacement effects apply to Hallowed Fountain entering: its own "you may pay 2 life" and Archon of
# Emeria's "nonbasic lands your opponents control enter tapped". Either way the land enters tapped, so which applies
# first changes nothing and its controller need not be asked: the card's ruling, "If an effect puts this land onto the
# battlefield tapped, you may pay 2 life, but it still enters tapped." Bot1 does not pay, and the land enters tapped.

